1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,192 --> 00:01:55,816
=Episode 19=

21
00:02:07,464 --> 00:02:08,650
(Mr. Dong)

22
00:02:08,650 --> 00:02:10,210
(Ms. Xu transferred the payment.)

23
00:02:12,251 --> 00:02:12,851
That's great.

24
00:02:15,624 --> 00:02:16,251
(Lu Hui)

25
00:02:16,251 --> 00:02:17,531
(You got what you wanted.)

26
00:02:18,131 --> 00:02:19,610
(Don't forget our deal.)

27
00:02:24,291 --> 00:02:25,011
Hello, Mr. Dong.

28
00:02:25,490 --> 00:02:26,730
Go over the factory contract.

29
00:02:27,170 --> 00:02:28,371
Finance kept quiet

30
00:02:28,411 --> 00:02:29,691
about Ms. Xu's transfer,

31
00:02:30,011 --> 00:02:31,691
so Mrs. Di took advantage of the gap.

32
00:02:32,251 --> 00:02:33,251
By her signing authority,

33
00:02:33,490 --> 00:02:34,691
she rushed work through legal

34
00:02:34,770 --> 00:02:35,610
and finance.

35
00:02:36,131 --> 00:02:37,050
Jinghua has already

36
00:02:37,050 --> 00:02:37,811
signed a new factory

37
00:02:38,011 --> 00:02:38,851
and placed orders.

38
00:02:39,730 --> 00:02:40,371
Go on.

39
00:02:40,971 --> 00:02:41,770
Also,

40
00:02:42,291 --> 00:02:43,251
she already

41
00:02:43,251 --> 00:02:45,050
sent the share transfer deal
to the board,

42
00:02:45,811 --> 00:02:46,770
applying

43
00:02:46,890 --> 00:02:47,971
to take over the 45% stake

44
00:02:48,011 --> 00:02:49,411
under her dad's name.

45
00:02:49,971 --> 00:02:51,011
Since it's compliant,

46
00:02:51,571 --> 00:02:52,691
almost nobody objected.

47
00:02:53,811 --> 00:02:54,371
Good.

48
00:02:56,091 --> 00:02:57,411
Help speed up the process.

49
00:02:58,210 --> 00:02:59,770
Let her get the shares sooner.

50
00:03:00,291 --> 00:03:00,730
Okay.

51
00:03:01,411 --> 00:03:01,851
By the way,

52
00:03:03,291 --> 00:03:04,251
reach out to

53
00:03:04,490 --> 00:03:05,650
minority shareholders looking

54
00:03:05,691 --> 00:03:06,170
to sell.

55
00:03:06,930 --> 00:03:08,131
Tell them I'm looking to buy.

56
00:03:08,610 --> 00:03:09,131
Understood.

57
00:03:17,768 --> 00:03:18,984
(Ms. Xu)

58
00:03:21,770 --> 00:03:23,131
I know you will blame me,

59
00:03:23,411 --> 00:03:24,730
but you're at fault too.

60
00:03:25,371 --> 00:03:27,450
Blame yourself
for not keeping your people in check.

61
00:03:27,890 --> 00:03:28,291
Who?

62
00:03:28,770 --> 00:03:30,251
Your housekeeper is quite capable.

63
00:03:42,248 --> 00:03:42,856
(Lu Hui)

64
00:03:43,011 --> 00:03:43,650
Sorry,

65
00:03:43,890 --> 00:03:44,811
the number you dialed

66
00:03:44,851 --> 00:03:46,011
is currently unavailable.

67
00:03:46,411 --> 00:03:47,571
Please try again later.

68
00:03:48,050 --> 00:03:48,571
Sorry...

69
00:03:56,170 --> 00:03:56,851
Wrong password.

70
00:04:02,411 --> 00:04:03,371
Wrong password.

71
00:04:12,776 --> 00:04:17,384
(Haoyu)

72
00:04:20,171 --> 00:04:20,931
Where did you go?

73
00:04:21,970 --> 00:04:22,530
I'm outside.

74
00:04:23,450 --> 00:04:24,131
Stop prying.

75
00:04:24,691 --> 00:04:25,811
If Mom keeps that attitude

76
00:04:25,811 --> 00:04:26,491
and mindset,

77
00:04:26,931 --> 00:04:27,890
I'm not going home.

78
00:04:29,491 --> 00:04:31,131
Why hold a grudge against your mom?

79
00:04:32,251 --> 00:04:33,210
Come talk to me.

80
00:04:34,371 --> 00:04:35,770
If you want to lobby for her,

81
00:04:36,251 --> 00:04:36,731
forget it.

82
00:04:38,691 --> 00:04:39,970
Didn't you want me to choose

83
00:04:39,970 --> 00:04:41,251
between Yu Meng and your mom?

84
00:04:42,530 --> 00:04:43,691
Want to hear my answer?

85
00:04:45,611 --> 00:04:47,131
Tell me. What is it?

86
00:04:49,171 --> 00:04:50,450
Haven't skipped stones in ages.

87
00:04:53,330 --> 00:04:53,770
Here.

88
00:04:54,290 --> 00:04:54,931
Want to try?

89
00:04:59,890 --> 00:05:01,011
You hated being hospitalized.

90
00:05:02,731 --> 00:05:03,611
Every time,

91
00:05:04,210 --> 00:05:05,450
you made me pinky swear

92
00:05:05,731 --> 00:05:07,251
to play this with you

93
00:05:07,811 --> 00:05:08,811
after discharge.

94
00:05:10,850 --> 00:05:11,970
Remember how many times you

95
00:05:11,970 --> 00:05:13,571
begged me to take you skipping stones?

96
00:05:14,691 --> 00:05:15,650
23 times.

97
00:05:17,491 --> 00:05:18,330
It means

98
00:05:18,330 --> 00:05:19,611
you were hospitalized 23 times.

99
00:05:20,051 --> 00:05:21,090
Fortunately,

100
00:05:21,491 --> 00:05:23,290
after your surgery at 15,

101
00:05:23,450 --> 00:05:24,611
no more hospital stays for you.

102
00:05:33,611 --> 00:05:35,090
You looked happy back then,

103
00:05:36,171 --> 00:05:37,371
but I didn't,

104
00:05:39,131 --> 00:05:40,290
because you were sensible.

105
00:05:41,371 --> 00:05:41,970
You knew

106
00:05:42,011 --> 00:05:42,931
we spent everything

107
00:05:43,090 --> 00:05:43,731
treating you.

108
00:05:44,210 --> 00:05:45,210
Your mom was scared

109
00:05:45,770 --> 00:05:47,011
a park would overexcite you,

110
00:05:47,410 --> 00:05:48,171
making you sicker.

111
00:05:50,571 --> 00:05:51,131
So you never

112
00:05:51,171 --> 00:05:52,011
threw a tantrum once

113
00:05:52,051 --> 00:05:53,051
to go to a theme park.

114
00:05:53,571 --> 00:05:55,051
That's why on my tenth birthday,

115
00:05:56,171 --> 00:05:57,171
you secretly took me

116
00:05:57,210 --> 00:05:58,011
to a theme park.

117
00:05:59,251 --> 00:06:00,410
That's our secret.

118
00:06:00,650 --> 00:06:01,850
You must never tell your mom,

119
00:06:02,731 --> 00:06:04,011
or she'll scold us both.

120
00:06:04,290 --> 00:06:05,131
I argued with her.

121
00:06:06,090 --> 00:06:07,051
Why would I tell her?

122
00:06:07,571 --> 00:06:08,530
Speaking of which,

123
00:06:09,131 --> 00:06:10,171
I have to call you out.

124
00:06:10,890 --> 00:06:11,850
I wanted to talk

125
00:06:11,850 --> 00:06:12,770
with your mom,

126
00:06:13,491 --> 00:06:14,931
but because you ran away,

127
00:06:15,850 --> 00:06:16,770
she's heartbroken

128
00:06:17,371 --> 00:06:18,210
and has no patience

129
00:06:18,251 --> 00:06:19,090
to talk with me.

130
00:06:19,090 --> 00:06:20,330
She always sees me as a child.

131
00:06:21,011 --> 00:06:21,970
She tells me nothing

132
00:06:22,890 --> 00:06:23,890
and never asks my opinion.

133
00:06:24,210 --> 00:06:25,210
She booked a flight fast

134
00:06:25,210 --> 00:06:26,011
to drag me abroad.

135
00:06:28,491 --> 00:06:29,090
Even so,

136
00:06:29,090 --> 00:06:30,371
you shouldn't have run away

137
00:06:30,611 --> 00:06:31,450
and upset her.

138
00:06:32,210 --> 00:06:33,090
There are many ways

139
00:06:33,171 --> 00:06:33,770
to fix this.

140
00:06:34,131 --> 00:06:34,850
You shouldn't

141
00:06:34,850 --> 00:06:36,090
pick the most reckless one.

142
00:06:38,491 --> 00:06:39,650
About going abroad,

143
00:06:40,450 --> 00:06:41,051
I can help you

144
00:06:41,210 --> 00:06:42,251
change your mom's mind.

145
00:06:46,770 --> 00:06:47,251
Really?

146
00:06:48,051 --> 00:06:49,131
On one condition:

147
00:06:49,611 --> 00:06:50,811
you must get her to meet me.

148
00:06:51,272 --> 00:06:52,008
(Yue+DECO)

149
00:06:52,691 --> 00:06:53,171
(Mom,)

150
00:06:53,450 --> 00:06:54,290
(at 2:00 PM,)

151
00:06:54,611 --> 00:06:55,450
(come here, please.)

152
00:07:01,611 --> 00:07:02,051
Hui.

153
00:07:09,890 --> 00:07:10,530
Why is it you?

154
00:07:11,931 --> 00:07:12,491
Where's Haoyu?

155
00:07:13,410 --> 00:07:13,890
Sit.

156
00:07:25,171 --> 00:07:26,131
He's fine right now.

157
00:07:27,210 --> 00:07:28,371
He doesn't want to see you.

158
00:07:28,731 --> 00:07:30,011
You used my son to lure me out?

159
00:07:31,171 --> 00:07:31,890
Despicable.

160
00:07:32,051 --> 00:07:34,090
You helped Yu Meng handle Ms. Xu

161
00:07:34,850 --> 00:07:35,491
and betrayed me.

162
00:07:35,931 --> 00:07:36,450
Not despicable?

163
00:07:40,290 --> 00:07:41,290
I knew it.

164
00:07:42,890 --> 00:07:44,290
I never thought someone close to me

165
00:07:44,611 --> 00:07:45,931
would treat me like this.

166
00:07:46,650 --> 00:07:47,611
You even want

167
00:07:47,611 --> 00:07:49,090
to secretly take our son abroad.

168
00:07:49,931 --> 00:07:51,450
Do you think you can just walk away

169
00:07:51,650 --> 00:07:52,890
with him that easily?

170
00:07:53,650 --> 00:07:54,611
I need money right now.

171
00:07:55,210 --> 00:07:56,371
Give it back,

172
00:07:56,890 --> 00:07:58,171
or don't think about leaving

173
00:07:58,251 --> 00:07:59,171
with our son.

174
00:08:01,571 --> 00:08:02,691
That's your true face.

175
00:08:03,450 --> 00:08:04,691
You claimed this money

176
00:08:04,770 --> 00:08:06,011
was put aside for him,

177
00:08:06,450 --> 00:08:07,491
but you never intended

178
00:08:07,491 --> 00:08:08,330
to leave it to him.

179
00:08:09,131 --> 00:08:09,811
Everything I have

180
00:08:09,890 --> 00:08:10,970
belongs to our son.

181
00:08:11,890 --> 00:08:13,290
And he matters more than money.

182
00:08:14,611 --> 00:08:15,530
I can give all I have

183
00:08:15,530 --> 00:08:16,410
to him,

184
00:08:16,450 --> 00:08:17,491
but not right now.

185
00:08:18,691 --> 00:08:19,770
I need the money

186
00:08:19,850 --> 00:08:20,770
to secure my footing.

187
00:08:21,090 --> 00:08:22,090
To be honest,

188
00:08:23,051 --> 00:08:24,450
Yu Meng has asked for a divorce,

189
00:08:25,450 --> 00:08:26,450
but I haven't agreed yet.

190
00:08:26,650 --> 00:08:27,450
Don't be mad.

191
00:08:27,811 --> 00:08:28,850
Why would I?

192
00:08:35,851 --> 00:08:37,091
I've been stalling the divorce

193
00:08:38,050 --> 00:08:38,971
because Yu Jianguo

194
00:08:38,971 --> 00:08:40,410
held the 45% stake

195
00:08:40,851 --> 00:08:42,410
in Jiali.

196
00:08:44,091 --> 00:08:44,930
If I divorced her,

197
00:08:45,371 --> 00:08:46,570
I wouldn't get any shares.

198
00:08:47,251 --> 00:08:48,491
But now it's different.

199
00:08:49,211 --> 00:08:50,530
She has finished the paperwork

200
00:08:50,650 --> 00:08:51,930
and officially holds the shares.

201
00:08:52,530 --> 00:08:53,371
If we divorce now,

202
00:08:53,530 --> 00:08:54,371
I can split shares

203
00:08:54,410 --> 00:08:55,570
50-50 with her.

204
00:08:55,851 --> 00:08:57,331
The urgent priority is

205
00:08:57,530 --> 00:08:58,451
to buy out the shares

206
00:08:58,570 --> 00:09:00,011
from the minority shareholders,

207
00:09:00,331 --> 00:09:01,410
so that when we divorce,

208
00:09:01,650 --> 00:09:02,451
I can ensure

209
00:09:02,570 --> 00:09:04,050
I hold more shares than her.

210
00:09:04,491 --> 00:09:06,211
Only then can I
take full control of Jiali.

211
00:09:07,011 --> 00:09:08,410
That's why I need the money.

212
00:09:08,491 --> 00:09:09,410
After all that talk,

213
00:09:09,851 --> 00:09:11,050
it's all about yourself.

214
00:09:11,451 --> 00:09:12,091
In your heart,

215
00:09:12,211 --> 00:09:13,410
you always come first.

216
00:09:14,410 --> 00:09:15,170
Protecting myself

217
00:09:15,290 --> 00:09:16,451
is what matters most.

218
00:09:17,131 --> 00:09:18,570
If I can't even protect myself,

219
00:09:18,890 --> 00:09:19,690
how am I supposed

220
00:09:19,690 --> 00:09:20,810
to take care of you two?

221
00:09:21,530 --> 00:09:22,810
Well, I'm not like you.

222
00:09:23,491 --> 00:09:24,170
I'd give my life

223
00:09:24,170 --> 00:09:24,930
for my son,

224
00:09:25,491 --> 00:09:26,011
unlike you.

225
00:09:29,131 --> 00:09:30,131
Until you drop your bias

226
00:09:30,211 --> 00:09:31,251
against me,

227
00:09:31,890 --> 00:09:33,170
nothing I say will matter.

228
00:09:36,451 --> 00:09:37,890
Just listen to me.

229
00:09:38,371 --> 00:09:39,570
Go to the bank with me now

230
00:09:39,770 --> 00:09:40,731
and transfer the money.

231
00:09:43,770 --> 00:09:45,050
To avoid drawing attention

232
00:09:46,371 --> 00:09:47,131
and keep them

233
00:09:47,410 --> 00:09:48,810
from tracing the funds,

234
00:09:49,331 --> 00:09:50,290
I split the money

235
00:09:50,290 --> 00:09:51,091
across several banks

236
00:09:51,331 --> 00:09:52,770
into various investment portfolios.

237
00:09:53,331 --> 00:09:53,930
So

238
00:09:54,331 --> 00:09:54,930
it's impossible

239
00:09:55,050 --> 00:09:56,050
to take it all out at once.

240
00:09:56,810 --> 00:09:58,050
Then today I only want the cash

241
00:09:58,050 --> 00:09:59,211
you currently have.

242
00:10:00,170 --> 00:10:00,530
Come.

243
00:10:01,251 --> 00:10:01,650
Let go!

244
00:10:01,650 --> 00:10:01,930
Move!

245
00:10:05,451 --> 00:10:05,971
Ma'am,

246
00:10:06,091 --> 00:10:06,851
your card balance

247
00:10:06,851 --> 00:10:07,770
is 730 thousand yuan.

248
00:10:07,890 --> 00:10:08,611
Sign on the pad

249
00:10:08,611 --> 00:10:09,530
to confirm it.

250
00:10:10,371 --> 00:10:11,011
(Remittance Application)
Check it over.

251
00:10:11,011 --> 00:10:11,731
The right account?

252
00:10:18,472 --> 00:10:19,624
(Applicant's Name)

253
00:10:19,624 --> 00:10:22,056
(Help)

254
00:10:27,930 --> 00:10:28,410
Ma'am,

255
00:10:28,570 --> 00:10:29,410
your transaction

256
00:10:29,410 --> 00:10:30,211
needs backend review.

257
00:10:30,410 --> 00:10:31,011
Wait a moment.

258
00:10:33,091 --> 00:10:33,690
What's wrong?

259
00:10:35,371 --> 00:10:36,650
It's standard bank procedure.

260
00:10:40,251 --> 00:10:40,930
Please wait.

261
00:10:46,491 --> 00:10:47,611
Does this lady need help?

262
00:10:47,650 --> 00:10:48,331
Help me.

263
00:10:49,211 --> 00:10:49,611
He is

264
00:10:49,611 --> 00:10:50,530
going for all my money.

265
00:10:51,971 --> 00:10:52,371
Sir,

266
00:10:52,770 --> 00:10:53,971
please show your ID.

267
00:10:58,211 --> 00:10:59,211
It's a misunderstanding.

268
00:11:01,050 --> 00:11:01,810
She used to be

269
00:11:01,890 --> 00:11:02,611
our housekeeper.

270
00:11:03,131 --> 00:11:03,770
We know each other.

271
00:11:04,131 --> 00:11:04,930
I don't know him!

272
00:11:05,810 --> 00:11:06,530
He threatened me

273
00:11:07,410 --> 00:11:08,410
to transfer money to him!

274
00:11:09,091 --> 00:11:09,770
Call the police.

275
00:11:10,290 --> 00:11:10,650
Okay.

276
00:11:10,890 --> 00:11:11,410
Wait.

277
00:11:12,456 --> 00:11:13,704
What's going on?

278
00:11:15,731 --> 00:11:16,650
Think this through.

279
00:11:17,050 --> 00:11:18,091
If you escalate this

280
00:11:18,690 --> 00:11:19,650
to the police,

281
00:11:20,251 --> 00:11:21,611
neither of us gets out clean.

282
00:11:23,752 --> 00:11:24,936
What a mess.

283
00:11:26,331 --> 00:11:27,451
It's a misunderstanding.

284
00:11:28,050 --> 00:11:28,930
She used to be

285
00:11:28,971 --> 00:11:29,650
our housekeeper.

286
00:11:30,011 --> 00:11:30,611
I can provide

287
00:11:30,611 --> 00:11:31,491
her work contract.

288
00:11:32,810 --> 00:11:33,731
She borrowed some money

289
00:11:33,851 --> 00:11:34,690
from me,

290
00:11:35,331 --> 00:11:36,211
then suddenly quit

291
00:11:36,211 --> 00:11:36,851
and disappeared.

292
00:11:37,650 --> 00:11:38,810
So I came to get it back.

293
00:11:39,530 --> 00:11:40,011
Of course,

294
00:11:40,570 --> 00:11:41,410
I can go with you

295
00:11:41,530 --> 00:11:42,810
and assist with the inquiry.

296
00:11:44,331 --> 00:11:44,890
Are you going?

297
00:11:48,530 --> 00:11:48,770
Go.

298
00:11:49,331 --> 00:11:49,770
I'm going.

299
00:11:59,570 --> 00:12:00,451
I just remembered

300
00:12:00,451 --> 00:12:01,491
I got other stuff to do.

301
00:12:01,810 --> 00:12:02,410
How about this?

302
00:12:04,091 --> 00:12:04,810
As for the money,

303
00:12:05,091 --> 00:12:06,131
I'll give you a few more days.

304
00:12:07,170 --> 00:12:08,371
I'll be back.

305
00:12:10,930 --> 00:12:11,570
Thank you.

306
00:12:13,371 --> 00:12:14,530
I'll settle it privately.

307
00:12:27,731 --> 00:12:28,371
Sorry.

308
00:12:33,371 --> 00:12:35,451
Congratulations
on launching Jinghua's production!

309
00:12:35,530 --> 00:12:37,290
It'll definitely be a huge hit
once released.

310
00:12:37,451 --> 00:12:38,011
We should

311
00:12:38,011 --> 00:12:39,050
also thank Mr. Jiao

312
00:12:39,170 --> 00:12:39,731
for finding us

313
00:12:39,770 --> 00:12:41,131
such a wonderful park.

314
00:12:43,251 --> 00:12:43,890
- Come on.
- Cheers!

315
00:12:44,251 --> 00:12:44,570
Cheers!

316
00:12:44,570 --> 00:12:46,091
Thanks for your congratulations, Zi.

317
00:12:46,131 --> 00:12:47,050
Cheers!

318
00:12:47,091 --> 00:12:48,011
Cheers!

319
00:12:50,184 --> 00:12:57,256
♪I write the future into a song,
honoring the brave with no regrets♪

320
00:12:57,800 --> 00:13:03,848
♪Turning all losses
into the passion of this moment♪

321
00:13:04,744 --> 00:13:11,944
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

322
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:17,736
♪Forging all weaknesses
into sharp, bold colors♪

323
00:13:18,971 --> 00:13:19,930
What a coincidence.

324
00:13:20,410 --> 00:13:21,770
Running into someone I know here.

325
00:13:22,770 --> 00:13:24,011
The one in the wheelchair

326
00:13:24,050 --> 00:13:24,690
is Weng Xin,

327
00:13:24,971 --> 00:13:25,770
Han Guang's wife.

328
00:13:27,251 --> 00:13:27,770
Yeah.

329
00:13:29,371 --> 00:13:31,290
Weng Yue's older sister.

330
00:13:31,650 --> 00:13:32,971
She looks about my age.

331
00:13:33,731 --> 00:13:34,810
When checking Han Guang's info,

332
00:13:34,810 --> 00:13:35,371
I learned

333
00:13:36,290 --> 00:13:37,211
she's two years older than you.

334
00:13:40,251 --> 00:13:40,810
How about

335
00:13:41,050 --> 00:13:42,011
I go say hello?

336
00:13:44,690 --> 00:13:45,251
Forget it.

337
00:13:45,770 --> 00:13:46,611
Don't disturb her.

338
00:13:53,096 --> 00:13:54,760
(Wu Ta)

339
00:13:56,331 --> 00:13:56,890
Zi,

340
00:13:56,971 --> 00:13:58,491
(Wu Ta)
what are you making for me?

341
00:13:59,170 --> 00:14:01,170
A Manhattan for you.

342
00:14:03,650 --> 00:14:04,371
Welcome.

343
00:14:07,851 --> 00:14:08,890
What are you doing here?

344
00:14:12,530 --> 00:14:13,251
Welcome.

345
00:14:13,530 --> 00:14:14,890
Haoyu hasn't come home in days.

346
00:14:16,211 --> 00:14:17,530
He won't answer my calls either.

347
00:14:18,491 --> 00:14:19,890
I want you to talk to him for me.

348
00:14:20,211 --> 00:14:21,491
Harry has indeed

349
00:14:22,251 --> 00:14:23,451
been staying at the club.

350
00:14:24,451 --> 00:14:25,690
Listen,

351
00:14:26,650 --> 00:14:27,611
he's a human being,

352
00:14:28,011 --> 00:14:28,851
not an object.

353
00:14:29,690 --> 00:14:31,170
He has his own choices to make.

354
00:14:32,690 --> 00:14:33,530
Even if I

355
00:14:33,530 --> 00:14:34,690
kick him out today,

356
00:14:35,211 --> 00:14:36,290
if he refuses to go home,

357
00:14:36,851 --> 00:14:38,170
he'll still find endless ways

358
00:14:38,211 --> 00:14:39,011
to defy you.

359
00:14:39,491 --> 00:14:40,211
To be honest,

360
00:14:41,251 --> 00:14:42,131
I have my own reasons

361
00:14:42,211 --> 00:14:43,331
to take him abroad

362
00:14:45,011 --> 00:14:46,290
as soon as possible.

363
00:14:47,810 --> 00:14:49,131
He listens to you more right now.

364
00:14:49,371 --> 00:14:50,170
I have no choice

365
00:14:50,170 --> 00:14:50,930
but to come to you.

366
00:14:51,290 --> 00:14:52,170
Because of Di Liren?

367
00:14:55,851 --> 00:14:56,930
Di Liren and I...

368
00:14:58,050 --> 00:14:59,251
I can't stop him.

369
00:14:59,851 --> 00:15:01,050
I won't touch his stuff again,

370
00:15:01,530 --> 00:15:02,410
and I'm not able to.

371
00:15:03,611 --> 00:15:04,451
I am

372
00:15:04,570 --> 00:15:05,570
staying out of your feud.

373
00:15:06,410 --> 00:15:07,491
I want to live in peace

374
00:15:07,491 --> 00:15:08,371
with Haoyu.

375
00:15:08,770 --> 00:15:10,131
Things have gotten to this point.

376
00:15:11,690 --> 00:15:13,331
You can't just quit

377
00:15:13,930 --> 00:15:15,211
or walk away whenever you want.

378
00:15:15,570 --> 00:15:16,890
Haoyu is innocent.

379
00:15:18,170 --> 00:15:19,131
He's never done anything

380
00:15:19,170 --> 00:15:20,170
to hurt you.

381
00:15:21,131 --> 00:15:22,170
If he finds out,

382
00:15:22,211 --> 00:15:23,170
he can't take it.

383
00:15:23,731 --> 00:15:24,570
Since I already

384
00:15:24,570 --> 00:15:25,410
helped you,

385
00:15:26,170 --> 00:15:27,011
please help me too.

386
00:15:27,930 --> 00:15:28,570
Convince him

387
00:15:29,091 --> 00:15:30,331
to leave with me quickly, okay?

388
00:15:31,570 --> 00:15:32,451
Haoyu

389
00:15:32,451 --> 00:15:33,290
is my only family.

390
00:15:34,211 --> 00:15:34,890
At least...

391
00:15:37,331 --> 00:15:38,731
Please persuade him not to hate me.

392
00:15:39,331 --> 00:15:40,491
I won't tell him.

393
00:15:41,770 --> 00:15:42,690
But not for your sake.

394
00:15:43,410 --> 00:15:44,331
It's for Harry.

395
00:15:46,211 --> 00:15:47,690
I don't want the world

396
00:15:48,410 --> 00:15:49,890
he built inside his heart

397
00:15:50,770 --> 00:15:51,690
to collapse completely.

398
00:15:53,690 --> 00:15:54,810
Thank you on Haoyu's behalf.

399
00:15:56,890 --> 00:15:58,371
Honestly, I really envy you.

400
00:16:00,570 --> 00:16:02,851
You were born lucky and have everything,

401
00:16:03,851 --> 00:16:04,491
unlike me.

402
00:16:05,611 --> 00:16:06,650
I've been unlucky.

403
00:16:06,890 --> 00:16:08,211
How you ended up here today

404
00:16:09,091 --> 00:16:09,930
has nothing to do

405
00:16:09,971 --> 00:16:10,890
with luck.

406
00:16:11,650 --> 00:16:12,971
You chose this path yourself.

407
00:16:13,570 --> 00:16:14,650
You chose to be

408
00:16:14,650 --> 00:16:15,570
Di Liren's puppet.

409
00:16:16,251 --> 00:16:17,211
You chose

410
00:16:17,810 --> 00:16:19,131
to tie your whole life

411
00:16:19,770 --> 00:16:21,050
to a man.

412
00:16:21,530 --> 00:16:22,611
I had no choice at all!

413
00:16:23,331 --> 00:16:24,650
If my mom hadn't died young,

414
00:16:24,650 --> 00:16:25,650
if my dad hadn't died,

415
00:16:25,930 --> 00:16:26,731
or if our factory

416
00:16:26,770 --> 00:16:27,690
still existed,

417
00:16:28,731 --> 00:16:29,290
if I still

418
00:16:29,290 --> 00:16:30,650
had a place in Xiaocheng,

419
00:16:32,170 --> 00:16:33,570
I'd be way better off than you.

420
00:16:35,731 --> 00:16:36,451
But my hardships

421
00:16:36,451 --> 00:16:37,611
just never ended.

422
00:16:37,768 --> 00:16:38,851
(Xiaocheng, 21 years ago)

423
00:16:38,851 --> 00:16:39,851
(I really had no choice.)

424
00:16:40,530 --> 00:16:41,290
(Back then,)

425
00:16:41,331 --> 00:16:42,410
(when I was helpless,)

426
00:16:43,251 --> 00:16:44,371
(Di Liren was the only one)

427
00:16:44,371 --> 00:16:45,290
(willing to help me.)

428
00:16:46,170 --> 00:16:47,050
(He wasn't a choice.)

429
00:16:48,570 --> 00:16:49,690
(He was my lifesaver.)

430
00:16:50,290 --> 00:16:51,611
(We depended on each other)

431
00:16:52,131 --> 00:16:53,011
(and got married.)

432
00:16:53,690 --> 00:16:54,851
(Desperate to hold onto him,)

433
00:16:55,851 --> 00:16:57,251
(I tried to have a baby.)

434
00:16:58,170 --> 00:16:59,050
(Our child.)

435
00:17:00,131 --> 00:17:01,050
(But unexpectedly,)

436
00:17:01,770 --> 00:17:03,050
(as soon as he was born,)

437
00:17:04,130 --> 00:17:06,610
(he was diagnosed
with congenital heart disease.)

438
00:17:07,651 --> 00:17:08,891
(To treat our child,)

439
00:17:10,211 --> 00:17:11,770
we sold everything we owned back then

440
00:17:12,651 --> 00:17:13,610
and borrowed money,

441
00:17:15,050 --> 00:17:15,931
but his condition

442
00:17:15,971 --> 00:17:17,050
didn't improve at all.

443
00:17:19,090 --> 00:17:19,971
I couldn't accept it.

444
00:17:21,090 --> 00:17:22,130
I really couldn't.

445
00:17:24,130 --> 00:17:24,850
And then?

446
00:17:27,290 --> 00:17:27,971
Have you ever

447
00:17:27,971 --> 00:17:29,171
seen a child suffocating?

448
00:17:30,770 --> 00:17:31,810
Purple lips,

449
00:17:32,491 --> 00:17:33,691
convulsing all over...

450
00:17:34,570 --> 00:17:35,731
He was so little,

451
00:17:36,850 --> 00:17:38,850
hurting too much to even cry,

452
00:17:39,651 --> 00:17:40,810
yet he tried to comfort me.

453
00:17:40,810 --> 00:17:41,211
He said...

454
00:17:44,090 --> 00:17:45,651
He said, "Mom, don't cry.

455
00:17:48,651 --> 00:17:50,211
Let's just stop the treatment."

456
00:17:52,770 --> 00:17:53,290
Later on,

457
00:17:55,411 --> 00:17:56,691
the doctor handed me

458
00:17:56,971 --> 00:17:57,931
the critical notice.

459
00:18:01,530 --> 00:18:02,770
A light piece of paper

460
00:18:04,651 --> 00:18:06,050
weighed me down

461
00:18:06,130 --> 00:18:06,731
so hard.

462
00:18:08,530 --> 00:18:09,171
(Liren...)

463
00:18:11,011 --> 00:18:12,451
(I saw him cry for the first time.)

464
00:18:13,330 --> 00:18:14,211
(The man)

465
00:18:14,211 --> 00:18:15,651
(who used to shield me)

466
00:18:16,850 --> 00:18:19,411
(clutched the payment slips,
crouched in the corner,)

467
00:18:20,290 --> 00:18:21,570
(shivering like a falling leaf.)

468
00:18:22,891 --> 00:18:23,931
Back then, Haoyu was lying

469
00:18:24,090 --> 00:18:25,370
in the intensive care unit.

470
00:18:25,770 --> 00:18:26,931
The doctor told us

471
00:18:28,090 --> 00:18:29,691
that if he didn't get surgery soon...

472
00:18:32,651 --> 00:18:34,011
At our most desperate moment,

473
00:18:37,171 --> 00:18:38,090
you showed up.

474
00:18:40,651 --> 00:18:42,011
You fell in love with my husband.

475
00:18:49,090 --> 00:18:49,651
Lu Hui,

476
00:18:50,251 --> 00:18:51,451
if you two hadn't conspired

477
00:18:51,530 --> 00:18:52,290
to deceive me,

478
00:18:52,491 --> 00:18:53,330
none of this

479
00:18:53,330 --> 00:18:54,610
would have ever happened!

480
00:18:56,130 --> 00:18:57,370
Your child's life matters,

481
00:18:57,971 --> 00:18:58,570
but

482
00:18:58,570 --> 00:18:59,451
what about the others?

483
00:19:00,330 --> 00:19:01,251
If you two hadn't done

484
00:19:01,290 --> 00:19:02,171
those wicked things,

485
00:19:02,411 --> 00:19:03,330
my dad wouldn't be

486
00:19:03,370 --> 00:19:04,090
in a coma,

487
00:19:04,491 --> 00:19:05,211
and my mom

488
00:19:05,211 --> 00:19:06,171
wouldn't be threatened.

489
00:19:06,891 --> 00:19:07,570
As for me,

490
00:19:08,731 --> 00:19:09,651
I could have

491
00:19:10,610 --> 00:19:11,850
had a happy family

492
00:19:12,370 --> 00:19:13,330
and an adorable baby!

493
00:19:13,971 --> 00:19:15,171
What did I do wrong?

494
00:19:15,451 --> 00:19:16,651
Do you think I wanted this?

495
00:19:18,011 --> 00:19:19,451
Every night as I lay in bed,

496
00:19:20,370 --> 00:19:21,651
all I could think about was

497
00:19:22,330 --> 00:19:23,610
my husband with another woman!

498
00:19:24,451 --> 00:19:25,891
Every time Haoyu asked for his dad,

499
00:19:26,090 --> 00:19:27,731
I had to make up a new lie.

500
00:19:29,211 --> 00:19:30,411
Do you know

501
00:19:30,931 --> 00:19:31,411
how it felt

502
00:19:31,411 --> 00:19:32,211
watching Liren walk

503
00:19:32,211 --> 00:19:33,171
into your house?

504
00:19:34,370 --> 00:19:34,931
I felt like

505
00:19:36,411 --> 00:19:39,090
my heart was being ripped brutally

506
00:19:39,090 --> 00:19:40,011
in two!

507
00:19:41,810 --> 00:19:43,171
On one side was my child's life,

508
00:19:44,971 --> 00:19:46,530
and on the other was the only support

509
00:19:47,570 --> 00:19:49,211
keeping me alive!

510
00:19:51,891 --> 00:19:54,090
I personally sent the man I loved most

511
00:19:55,050 --> 00:19:56,731
into another woman's bed!

512
00:19:59,251 --> 00:20:00,330
But what else could I do?

513
00:20:02,451 --> 00:20:03,931
I could live a worthless life.

514
00:20:04,731 --> 00:20:06,011
I could throw away my dignity,

515
00:20:08,171 --> 00:20:09,370
but my child...

516
00:20:11,130 --> 00:20:12,011
My child

517
00:20:12,011 --> 00:20:13,691
never even got to see the world.

518
00:20:16,090 --> 00:20:17,330
Was he supposed to just die?

519
00:20:21,171 --> 00:20:22,411
I gave Di Liren up to you

520
00:20:23,330 --> 00:20:24,731
because I'm a mother!

521
00:20:25,770 --> 00:20:26,891
For my child,

522
00:20:27,931 --> 00:20:29,211
I had no choice!

523
00:20:35,570 --> 00:20:36,370
I feel for you,

524
00:20:37,891 --> 00:20:39,411
but that's no excuse

525
00:20:40,251 --> 00:20:41,891
for conspiring to steal our company

526
00:20:42,530 --> 00:20:43,810
and our family's assets.

527
00:20:44,050 --> 00:20:44,570
Jiali

528
00:20:44,971 --> 00:20:45,971
grew from a tiny

529
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:47,011
cosmetics workshop

530
00:20:47,290 --> 00:20:48,731
to a big brand

531
00:20:49,731 --> 00:20:51,850
because Liren went all out for this!

532
00:20:52,971 --> 00:20:54,491
Every cent of Jiali's profit

533
00:20:55,211 --> 00:20:56,370
carries his blood and sweat!

534
00:20:57,290 --> 00:20:58,610
Every cent I received came

535
00:20:59,330 --> 00:21:01,090
from swallowing humiliation!

536
00:21:06,011 --> 00:21:06,451
Whatever.

537
00:21:08,370 --> 00:21:09,411
Stop that nonsense.

538
00:21:10,451 --> 00:21:11,610
I just want to tell you this:

539
00:21:12,570 --> 00:21:13,731
time will prove everything.

540
00:21:14,251 --> 00:21:15,931
Time will tell who was right and wrong.

541
00:21:20,251 --> 00:21:22,011
There's one thing I don't understand.

542
00:21:24,370 --> 00:21:25,370
Why did you save my dad?

543
00:21:26,050 --> 00:21:27,330
By your logic,

544
00:21:28,370 --> 00:21:29,850
shouldn't you have wanted him to die

545
00:21:30,570 --> 00:21:31,651
so you'd have the chance

546
00:21:32,491 --> 00:21:34,050
to swallow all of Jiali's shares?

547
00:21:34,530 --> 00:21:35,411
Believe it or not,

548
00:21:35,610 --> 00:21:36,850
I never wanted Jiali's shares.

549
00:21:36,891 --> 00:21:37,850
I only

550
00:21:38,810 --> 00:21:39,451
wanted

551
00:21:39,451 --> 00:21:40,530
what was rightfully mine.

552
00:21:41,451 --> 00:21:42,251
As for Mr. Yu,

553
00:21:42,971 --> 00:21:44,370
I never intended to harm him.

554
00:21:45,251 --> 00:21:46,570
When I saw him collapse,

555
00:21:48,011 --> 00:21:48,691
it was

556
00:21:48,691 --> 00:21:49,570
like seeing my dad.

557
00:21:50,891 --> 00:21:52,211
When my dad had a car accident,

558
00:21:53,411 --> 00:21:54,090
if someone

559
00:21:54,130 --> 00:21:55,050
had just helped him

560
00:21:56,050 --> 00:21:57,731
or called an ambulance earlier,

561
00:21:58,451 --> 00:21:59,570
he might not have died,

562
00:22:01,691 --> 00:22:02,491
and I wouldn't

563
00:22:02,491 --> 00:22:03,530
have lived like this now.

564
00:22:18,824 --> 00:22:22,504
(Wu TA)

565
00:22:25,610 --> 00:22:26,891
I'm counting on you.

566
00:22:27,610 --> 00:22:29,130
I know Di Liren well.

567
00:22:29,691 --> 00:22:31,130
Even if Harry agrees to go with you,

568
00:22:31,491 --> 00:22:32,411
Di Liren won't

569
00:22:32,411 --> 00:22:33,130
let you two go.

570
00:22:33,451 --> 00:22:34,090
He will.

571
00:22:34,770 --> 00:22:35,530
He wants money.

572
00:22:36,011 --> 00:22:37,330
Once Di Liren goes down,

573
00:22:38,290 --> 00:22:39,090
you'll be

574
00:22:39,130 --> 00:22:40,330
the first scapegoat.

575
00:22:40,810 --> 00:22:41,530
That's my business.

576
00:22:42,411 --> 00:22:43,171
I'll deal with it.

577
00:22:56,290 --> 00:22:57,411
I am thinking...

578
00:22:57,971 --> 00:22:59,130
You either

579
00:22:59,971 --> 00:23:01,090
conquer fate,

580
00:23:01,610 --> 00:23:02,770
or it conquers you.

581
00:23:03,691 --> 00:23:04,691
I choose the former.

582
00:23:05,171 --> 00:23:07,130
Yet she's still struggling.

583
00:23:07,691 --> 00:23:08,530
You've softened up?

584
00:23:08,891 --> 00:23:10,251
I have my own battle to fight.

585
00:23:24,451 --> 00:23:25,171
How did you get in?

586
00:23:25,850 --> 00:23:26,731
A locksmith helped.

587
00:23:28,130 --> 00:23:29,370
You changed your bank card PIN,

588
00:23:30,130 --> 00:23:31,691
and now even the door code.

589
00:23:32,171 --> 00:23:32,971
What are you up to?

590
00:23:35,290 --> 00:23:36,770
A real estate agent came today.

591
